Third-party components
- Jackson (jackson-core, jackson-databind, Apache-2.0) is shaded into the Bukkit agent as
  dev.proofstone.shaded.jackson. Its upstream LICENSE and NOTICE texts must travel with that jar.
- Other dependencies are either test-only or not redistributed. Their licences are listed in
  docs/adr/0011-licensing.md and docs/release-notes-0.1.0-DRAFT.md.
- ViaProxy (GPL-3.0) runs only as a separate, unmodified container image. It is not redistributed.
- The Paper and Spigot APIs are compile-only and not redistributed.
